{"ticker":"KIOCL","symbol":"KIOCL","instrumentId":3141235,"name":"Kiocl","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"KIOCL Limited (Kudremukh Iron Ore Company Limited) is a leading government-owned enterprise specializing in the mining, beneficiation, and production of iron ore pellets. Located in Karnataka, the company operates iron ore mines and a state-of-the-art pellet plant, producing high-grade pellets used in steel manufacturing. KIOCL caters to both domestic and international markets, providing essential raw materials that enhance the efficiency of steel production. The company is committed to sustainable mining practices and environmental conservation, focusing on reducing its carbon footprint. With a robust supply chain, KIOCL plays a crucial role in supporting the growth and development of the steel industry.","website":"www.kioclltd.in","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:35:40.693Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":325.2,"changePct":-0.5960568546538251,"week52High":419.9,"week52Low":296.9},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹19,764 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹718 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"6,077,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"13"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"396,761"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.42%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"11.38"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.01"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.78"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"321.98"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"51–1,494"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"1.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"1.3"},{"label":"Volume","value":"22,253"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"73,999"},{"label":"Master score","value":"62"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"48"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"37"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"83"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"A-"}],